{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07640","headline":"邺城怀古 · 孟云卿","name":"邺城怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝发淇水南，将寻北燕路。\n魏家旧城阙，寥落无人住。\n伊昔天地屯，曹公独中据。\n羣臣将北面，白日忽西暮。\n三台竟寂寞，万事良难固。\n雄图安在哉？衰草沾霜露。\n崔嵬长河北，尚见应刘墓。\n古树藏龙蛇，荒茅伏狐兔。\n永怀故池馆，数子连章句。\n逸兴驱山河，雄词变云雾。\n我行覩遗迹，精爽如可遇。\n斗酒将酹君，悲风白杨树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}